    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d190">

                <pb facs="0263" n="155" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg155"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Young.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-12"><hi rendition="#italic">November 12,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>You may answer Honduras minister that, having reported his reply, you are
                    instructed to say that the President accepts these frank expressions of
                    disavowal and regret as sufficient and will waive further formal apology in the
                    interest of friendly feeling.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
